<title>USA: IPO PRICING-RIT prices within range at $8.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-RIT prices within range at $8.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	 RIT Technologies Limited</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $8</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	   $7.50 - $9.50</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			2,300,000</p>
<p>   Underwriters     Untenberg Harris and Pennsylvania Merchant</p>
<p>Group Limited</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of shares for the planned initial public offering in RIT Technologies Limited was  raised to 2.3 million shares from 2.25 million shares originally.</p>
<p>The underwriters have been granted an option to purchase up to 287,500 additional shares to cover over-allotments.</p>
</text>
